<title>LATVIA: DAUGAVPILS SLIPS, STRENCI UP AGAIN ON BOURSE.</title>
<headline>DAUGAVPILS SLIPS, STRENCI UP AGAIN ON BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daugavpils Chain ended a long</p>
<p>period of stability on Thursday, sliding to 1.01 lats from 1.15</p>
<p>lats while Strenci Forestry again rose, climbing to 1.64 lats</p>
<p>from 1.60.</p>
